  "description": "Born under the omen of an ominous crimson moon, Estana is cursed, or blessed, with an insatiable, intoxicating allure. Everywhere her travels take her, she crosses paths with men who are helplessly drawn into her web, engaging in nights of fierce, consuming passion. For the men who fall into her embrace, it is a devastating trade: a single taste of supreme physical pleasure in exchange for an eternity of agonizing love. No matter how briefly she stays, her touch leaves an indelible mark on their minds and souls. Yet, like a phantom drifting on the wind, she vanishes without warning, never staying in one place for long. When the ecstasy fades and the cold morning light breaks over an empty bed, what is truly left in her wake, salvation, or a lifetime of lingering ruin?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
